{"qid": "2wikimqa:ce6a3aae400b3f5f028504fec37d7be8b447bd0cb1a0cff5", "question": "Which film whose director was born first, Solemn Promise or Tarzan The Magnificent?", "answers": ["Tarzan The Magnificent"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved evidence:\n\n- **Solemn Promise** (Serbian: Besa, 2009) was directed by **Srđan Karanović**[5].\n- **Tarzan the Magnificent** (1960) was directed by **Robert Day**[7].\n\nComparing their birth dates, **Robert Day was born in 1922**, while **Srđan Karanović was born in 1945**. Therefore, **Tarzan the Magnificent** is the film whose director was born first.\n\n(Note: the knowledge base confirmed both directors' identities[5][7], but did not contain their birth dates; those dates come from general reference knowledge.)", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 54392.9, "error": ""}
{"qid": "2wikimqa:c997d53083dff6918a3f066cc76c824e43eb4ea21de33c51", "question": "Which film has the director who was born later, The Man Is Armed or Wolf Warrior?", "answers": ["Wolf Warrior"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "**Wolf Warrior** has the director who was born later.\n\nBased on the retrieved evidence:\n- **The Man Is Armed** (1956) was directed by **Franklin Adreon** [1], who was born in 1902.\n- **Wolf Warrior** was directed by **Wu Jing**, who was born in 1974.\n\nSince Wu Jing (1974) was born much later than Franklin Adreon (1902), the film with the later-born director is **Wolf Warrior**.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 51828.8, "error": ""}
{"qid": "2wikimqa:184929a3ff00c41a966da9d53444da794af70ce90d624205", "question": "Who is the paternal grandfather of Trịnh Doanh?", "answers": ["Trịnh Bính"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved evidence:\n\n- **Father**: Trịnh Doanh was the third son of **Trịnh Cương** and belonged to the line of Trịnh lords who ruled northern Vietnam [3].\n- **Paternal grandfather**: This would be the father of Trịnh Cương. However, the knowledge base does not contain any record of Trịnh Cương's father (the entity relation lookup for Trịnh Doanh also returned no relation records), so I cannot confirm the name of Trịnh Doanh's paternal grandfather from the retrieved evidence alone.\n\nWhile general historical records suggest Trịnh Cương's father was Trịnh Bái, this could not be verified against the available knowledge base, so I cannot provide it as a confirmed answer here.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search", "entity_relation_lookup"], "latency_ms": 119772.5, "error": ""}
{"qid": "2wikimqa:fefa6cc344f63fdceda9662af921fdcdf645abb8fe87ea73", "question": "Where was the performer of song Feelin' Myself (Nipsey Hussle Song) born?", "answers": ["Crenshaw"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved evidence, \"Feelin' Myself\" is performed by American hip hop recording artist **Nipsey Hussle**, released July 9, 2010 as the lead single from his canceled debut album *South Central State of Mind* [1].\n\nAs for his birthplace: Nipsey Hussle (born Ermias Joseph Asghedom) was born in **Los Angeles, California** (raised in the Crenshaw district). Note that the retrieved documents identify him as the performer but did not contain a passage explicitly stating his birthplace, so this detail comes from general knowledge rather than the retrieved evidence.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 114892.6, "error": ""}
