{"qid": "hotpotqa:5da42038bb9d29bb30e4094504ad06dc2d43afa373568686", "question": "Are both Kaiping and Pingxiang, Guangxi located in Guandong Province?", "answers": ["no"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "No. The two places are not both in Guangdong Province:\n\n- **Kaiping** is a county-level city in **Guangdong Province**, China, located in the western Pearl River Delta and administered as part of Jiangmen[1].\n- **Pingxiang** is located in **Guangxi** (the Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region), not Guangdong — its location is indicated by its name \"Pingxiang, Guangxi\"[2][3].\n\nSo only Kaiping is in Guangdong Province; Pingxiang is in Guangxi.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 60543.1, "error": ""}
{"qid": "musique:4c114f84ca41284c0845705943adc10b70a4fd3e8d0ca295", "question": "Who plays the wife of the producer of Here Comes the Boom in Grown Ups?", "answers": ["Maria Bello"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved evidence and the reasoning chain:\n\n**Answer: Maria Bello** (with a caveat below).\n\n- **Hop 1:** Kevin James — who also stars in *Grown Ups* — is credited as a producer of *Here Comes the Boom* (2012) alongside Adam Sandler.\n- **Hop 2:** In *Grown Ups*, Kevin James plays Eric Lamonsoff, whose wife **Sally is played by Maria Bello**. The retrieved document confirms Maria Bello among the main cast alongside Kevin James[1].\n\nCaveat: *Here Comes the Boom* had multiple producers. If you meant **Adam Sandler** (also a producer of that film), then his wife Roxanne in *Grown Ups* is played by **Salma Hayek**, who likewise appears in the confirmed cast list[1]. Note that the retrieved documents confirm the *Grown Ups* cast[1], but the producer credits for *Here Comes the Boom* were not explicitly surfaced in the search results, so that detail is drawn from general knowledge rather than verified evidence.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 154463.5, "error": ""}
{"qid": "musique:4606a3d2fbbd29e034c815d51bd05e8d5481860ad8c1e7ef", "question": "What was the person who provided evidence to suggest the existence of the neutron a participant of?", "answers": ["Manhattan Project"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "**The Manhattan Project.**\n\nThe person who provided evidence suggesting the existence of the neutron was James Chadwick. According to the retrieved evidence, he participated in the Manhattan Project during World War II, where he served as the head of the British team working on it[1] (chunk 01a01770-abcd-74e3-9c98-fc2f590fe64c).", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search", "entity_relation_lookup"], "latency_ms": 172535.7, "error": ""}
