{"qid": "2wikimqa:9b0dc01a1388db020e5c5c428a002d099f8a35544e9b6261", "question": "Which film whose director is younger, Winter Sleepers or Poveri Milionari?", "answers": ["Winter Sleepers"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved evidence:\n\n- **Winter Sleepers** (1997 German film) was directed by **Tom Tykwer**, who was born on May 15, 1965[1].\n- **Poveri Milionari** (1959 Italian comedy) was directed by **Dino Risi**, who was born on December 23, 1916. (Note: the knowledge base search did not return verifiable evidence for Poveri Milionari's director before the retrieval limit was reached, so this relies on general knowledge.)\n\nComparing the two directors, Tom Tykwer (born 1965) is considerably younger than Dino Risi (born 1916).\n\n**Answer: Winter Sleepers** — its director, Tom Tykwer, is the younger of the two directors.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 63100.9, "error": ""}
{"qid": "2wikimqa:93ef40c0bfa088c2a2dd3302976a950cba3e8d97767f65ce", "question": "Which film has the director who died earlier, Mayor Muthanna or The Market Of Souls?", "answers": ["The Market Of Souls"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "**The Market of Souls** has the director who died earlier.\n\n- *The Market of Souls* was directed by **Joe De Grasse**[2], who died in 1940.\n- *Mayor Muthanna* was directed by **Siddalingaiah**[3], who died in 2015.\n\nSince 1940 is earlier than 2015, the film with the earlier-dying director is **The Market of Souls**.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 70695.9, "error": ""}
