{"qid": "musique:79669636487de3810792f2a9a1b4a7c253da580013d1d2fb", "question": "What is the abbreviated name of the exclusive platform of the video game named for the league with a halftime event just before the publishers clearing house sweepstakes drawing.", "answers": ["NES", "Family Computer", "Famicom", "Nintendo Entertainment System"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "**Partial answer based on retrieved evidence:**\n\n- Publishers Clearing House began announcing its $10 million sweepstakes winners **just after the Super Bowl**, meaning the Super Bowl halftime show takes place just before the drawing[5].\n- The Super Bowl is the championship game of the **National Football League (NFL)**, so the league in question is the NFL.\n\nHowever, the knowledge base retrieval did not return any document identifying the specific NFL‑named video game or its exclusive platform, so I cannot verify the abbreviated platform name (e.g., PS, 3DS, Xbox) without inventing facts. **I can confirm the league is the NFL, but I do not have evidence for the exact video game and its exclusive platform abbreviation.**", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 449294.3, "error": ""}
